<h5 class="text-white mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf text-primary me-2"></i> <?= __('Instructions: PDF Form Designer') ?></h5>
<p><?= __('Create and edit visual PDF template layouts for your forms. Each form can have one active PDF design.') ?></p>
<ul>
    <li><strong><?= __('New PDF Design:') ?></strong> <?= __('Click "New PDF Design" next to a form that has no design yet to open the editor with a blank A4 canvas.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Edit Existing Design:') ?></strong> <?= __('Click "Design PDF" next to a form that already has a design to modify it.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Form Fields:') ?></strong> <?= __('Drag form fields onto the A4 canvas to position submission values. Each field shows its label and key.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Static Elements:') ?></strong> <?= __('Add static text, images, lines, borders, tables and bullet lists to customize your PDF layout.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Table:') ?></strong> <?= __('Set number of rows and columns. Enter cell content one per line in the properties panel.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Bullet List:') ?></strong> <?= __('Enter each bullet item on a separate line in the properties panel.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Element Properties:') ?></strong> <?= __('Click any element on the canvas to adjust position, size, font size, alignment, and other settings.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('Save Design:') ?></strong> <?= __('Click "Save Design" to store the current layout. The design applies to all future PDF generations for that form.') ?></li>
    <li><strong><?= __('View / Download PDF:') ?></strong> <?= __('On any submission view page, use "View PDF" to preview in browser or "Download PDF" to save the file.') ?></li>
</ul>
